                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Space-based RTS game where you build a base, gather resources, develop technologies, and command a fleet in the fight for control over planets and star systems\n\n✅Blend of strategy and a space theme\n✅3D view allowing you to watch battles and ships\n✅Ability to customize ship behavior\n✅Expansive world with its own history and mythology\n✅Good price\n\n❌Despite the good AI, you still need to keep an eye on your ships during combat, especially in more complex engagements\n❌Significant disparity in unit strength between factions,weaker ships can struggle immensely even against lower-tier units\n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [b] Good [/b], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game and indie games)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
